s the queen but Black simply moves it and maintains the advantage\n\nGiven my material disadvantage, I need to create immediate threats and complications around Black's exposed king. The advanced f-pawn is my best asset.\n\nReason: f5-f6 creates immediate tactical pressure on Black's king position. It threatens g7, opens potential attacking lines, and forces Black to deal with a dangerous passed pawn. With my material deficit, I need active piece play and concrete threats rather than slow maneuvering.\n\nAnswer: P: f5-f6"}
